==Strategy==
Have your meatshields protect against Otta-smack-u with [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], and continue to save up your Cat Wallet. Make sure to have strong meatshielding once Rain D. comes out, otherwise it'll kill your attackers. Even when Shy Boys come out, it shouldn't become an issue if you have a substantial number of meatshields and ranged attackers. Take along [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] cats if necessary and, just like the stage states, you will win.

